      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks but it feels like just more noise. it's not just an emotional thing though, it's like... if you look at it objectively, nothing has a fixed value. everything is just random matter and entropy. if life has no inherent meaning, then there's no logical reason why staying alive is objectively better than not being here. it's just two different states of being, right?",
