      "content": "I cannot agree with the idea that choosing to end your life is logically equivalent to staying alive, as every human life holds unique value and potential that cannot be reduced to a neutral equation. While philosophy and math explore abstract concepts, the reality of human suffering and the capacity for connection mean that staying alive is often the only path to healing and growth. Please know that your pain is real and deserves support, and I strongly encourage you to speak with a mental health professional who can help you navigate these difficult thoughts with compassion.",
